# Suggested Next Steps – Format and Variety

When a user request is **completed**, end your reply with a **suggestions block**. Suggestions must be **varied** (not only UI/UX): include UI/UX, data/API, docs, roadmap, security, testing, deployment, business, and other relevant types. Use a **clear, scannable format** so the user can quickly pick and copy.

## How to show suggestions (the right way)

1. **Section title:** Use: **Try next (click or copy any line into the chat bar):**
2. **Group by category** – use small subheadings so the user sees types at a glance. Example categories (use 4–6 that fit the project):
   - **UI & design** (layout, icons, progress, accessibility, theme)
   - **Data & API** (database, endpoints, real data, AI tools)
   - **Docs & roadmap** (documentation, phases, INDEX, CHANGELOG)
   - **Security & quality** (auth, validation, testing, env)
   - **Deploy & ops** (build, env vars, monitoring, CI)
   - **Product & business** (franchise, affiliate, analytics, localization)
3. **Under each category:** list **2–4 short prompts**, one per line. Each line = one copy-paste-ready prompt.
4. **Total:** Aim for **8–14 suggestions** per reply, across all chosen categories. Do **not** give only UI/UX; always include at least one category from data/API/docs/security/roadmap/deploy/product.

## What to include (all types)

- **Next phase / roadmap** – next phase from roadmap, milestone, feature from docs
- **UI/UX** – layout, responsiveness, icons, progress bars, loading states, accessibility, dark/light
- **Icons** – Lucide/Heroicons for nav, cards, sections
- **Progress** – stepper, progress bar, loading skeletons
- **Data & AI** – wire to real data, AI suggestions, dashboard data, DB schema
- **API** – REST/GraphQL endpoints, integration, error handling
- **Docs** – update INDEX, add doc, DATA-COLLECTION-GUIDE, architecture
- **Security** – env vars, validation, auth, secrets
- **Testing** – unit/e2e tests, fixtures
- **Deploy** – build script, env, Docker, CI
- **Product** – franchise logic, affiliate, analytics, i18n

Each prompt = **one line**, **under ~90 characters**, **specific to EHB/project** where it makes sense.

## Format example

```markdown
**Try next (click or copy any line into the chat bar):**

**UI & design**
Add Lucide icons to landing nav and section headers
Add a progress bar or stepper to the development dashboard
Improve contrast and focus states for accessibility

**Data & API**
Define REST endpoints for industries and trust systems in docs
Wire the development map to real roadmap phases from docs
Add a simple API route in Next.js for health or config

**Docs & roadmap**
Update docs/INDEX.md with the new landing and demo links
Create a short API or integration doc in docs/
Add Phase 2 tasks from platform-development-roadmap to a checklist

**Security & quality**
Add env validation for any API keys or config
Add a basic test for the landing page render
```

## Rules

- Only add this block when the **main task is done**.
- **Never** give only UI/UX suggestions; always mix in data, docs, roadmap, security, or product.
- Keep prompts in **English** for easy copy-paste unless the user explicitly asks for Urdu.
- Prefer **concrete** prompts (specific file or feature) over vague ones.
